# Pairs with EveryCommitAudited. The intent lives only in the caller (or is
# cleaned up when the caller stops), so a crash between the commit and the
# finalize leaves a committed mutation with no audit record at all.
MODULE: AuditDropEmissionOnCrash
TARGET: EveryCommitAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a caller that crashes between commit and finalize takes its intent with it
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ op' = [op EXCEPT ![o] = [@ EXCEPT !.pc = "crashed", !.live = @ /\ op[o].result = "undecided"]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<present, hist, pending, finals, env>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ op' = [op EXCEPT ![o] = [@ EXCEPT !.pc = "crashed", !.live = @ /\ op[o].result = "undecided"]]
\* MUTATION: the crash path drops the intent.
    /\ pending' = pending \ {o}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<present, hist, finals, env>>
--- END
